{"3506450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Inner City Unit", "steam_appid": 3506450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A WORLD OF VICES -</strong> Collect, buy, sell, and use a cornucopia of illicit substances.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN OPEN PRISON -</strong> Strut down Mainline Avenue, scale rooftops, wade through sewers. Accomplish your objectives from whatever angle you see fit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506450/extras/d59850e5a2f6286c9479f6bbae3bc244.poster.avif?t=1787902771\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506450/extras/d59850e5a2f6286c9479f6bbae3bc244.webm?t=1787902771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506450/extras/d59850e5a2f6286c9479f6bbae3bc244.mp4?t=1787902771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FRACTURED IDENTITY -</strong> Live as Albert Buchanan, but for how long? Assume different identities. Characters will remember actions performed as different identities and respond differently depending on your current persona.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO CORRECT METHOD -</strong> Inform on your neighbours, rob a protein merchant, poison your rivals, amass a stockpile of illegal munitions, misdirect law enforcement for your own gain. Annexia is yours to exploit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506450/extras/faab88ca1942b842e2cd09eea53a6c28.poster.avif?t=1787902771\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506450/extras/faab88ca1942b842e2cd09eea53a6c28.webm?t=1787902771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506450/extras/faab88ca1942b842e2cd09eea53a6c28.mp4?t=1787902771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE ACUTE ALCOHOLISM -</strong> As a semi-functional alcoholic you must keep the drinks flowing to keep delirium tremens at bay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGO MODIFIERS -</strong> Rewire your mind and body with digital ego modifiers. Strengthen your fists, sharpen your tongue, blend into the shadows. Choose how you want to operate and modify yourself in that image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506450/extras/c82985c6f813cbb0e76f2afe9437bf2d.poster.avif?t=1787902771\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506450/extras/c82985c6f813cbb0e76f2afe9437bf2d.webm?t=1787902771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506450/extras/c82985c6f813cbb0e76f2afe9437bf2d.mp4?t=1787902771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A WORLD OF VICES -</strong> Collect, buy, sell, and use a cornucopia of illicit substances.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN OPEN PRISON -</strong> Strut down Mainline Avenue, scale rooftops, wade through sewers. Accomplish you